{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39767","headline":"广州试越台怀古 · 黄滔","name":"广州试越台怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南越千年事，兴怀一旦来。\n歌钟非旧俗，烟月有层台。\n北望人何在，东流水不回。\n吹窗风杂瘴，沾槛雨经梅。\n壮气曾难揖，空名信可哀。\n不堪登览处，花落与花开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}